note fleet_demo.jc: a launch-readiness panel, three agents asked in parallel.
note Needs a mind: export JESUNCODE_AI_COMMAND="..." first, for example the
note Pollinations provider installed by install.sh.

to read_notes
    give back "Launch is Sep 30. Budget is 40k. 3 blockers open."

to read_metrics
    give back "signups: 1200, churn: 2%, uptime: 99.9%"

agent researcher
    persona is "You are a careful desk researcher. Answer in one sentence."
    tools are [read_notes]

agent numbers
    persona is "You are a metrics analyst. Answer in one sentence."
    tools are [read_metrics]

agent critic
    persona is "You are a skeptical reviewer. Answer in one sentence."

fleet panel with researcher and numbers and critic
    memory file is "panel_memory.json"
    ask researcher "what is the launch date?" giving launch
    ask numbers "how is the business doing?" giving health
    ask critic "what is the biggest risk?" giving risk

show "the panel says:"
show panel
show launch
show health
show risk
